{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46、6期生の鈴木佑捺です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2025年、沢山の活動を通して6期生を支えてくださった皆さま本当にありがとうございました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46に加入してから10ヶ月間とは思えないほど、沢山の経験をさせて頂きました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/moblHoTWf.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mob7rotBG.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "懐かしいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/moba9ces3.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobppC803.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobHwtmVq.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "憧れの紫ゼッケンはじめましての日"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨日はねゆっくりできる時間があったので今年一年は、どんな年だったのかなと\n日記を見返しながら、自分で並べた文字を静かに追ってみました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "振り返ってみると力の抜けた字の日もあれば、\nビックリマークがやけに多くて、\nきっとこの日は、嬉しいことがあったんだろうなって分かる日もあって。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ある時は、一ヶ月まるまる何も書かれていないページもありました\nそれだけ、文字にする前に感情が大きく動いていた時間だったんだなと、文字だけでも伝わってくるくらいに\n2025年は濃い時間でした☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はとくにみんなに引かれちゃうくらいに思い出話が大好きなので、話し出したらきりがないです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とくに嬉しかったできごとは\nBIRTHDAY LIVEと19歳のお誕生日！一生忘れません🎂"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026年は今日大晦日で一年を振り返って、\n目標を立てようとおもいます！\n目標を聞かれる度に、違うことが思いついて決まらないけどそれだけもっと色んなことに挑戦したいと思えた年末でした！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026年もどうぞよろしくお願いします！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "残り数時間最後まで楽しみます🐍"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2025年本当にありがとうございました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさま、良いお年をお迎えください"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "佑捺"}], "source": "official"}